    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Sound of the Soul&quot; captures the multifaceted nature of this extraordinary celebration by deftly weaving together the parallel threads of commentaries from various musicians and live discussions from an international symposium on &quot;The Soul of Globalization.&quot; This ultimately reveals the true power of an Afghan singer&apos;s affirmation: &quot;Music has no religion, no borders, no boundaries, music is the sound of the soul.&quot;</marc:subfield>
